OL,3,GNEWSALeeds data centre plan defended by
OL,4,Amayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of West Yorkshire has backed
OL,7,Fplans to build a data centre on the
OL,8,Foutskirts of Leeds.
OL,10,FTechnology giant Microsoft has been
OL,11,Fgranted permission by Leeds City
OL,12,FCouncil to create the facility at the
OL,13,Fformer Skelton Grange power station
OL,14,Fsite in Stourton - but there is
OL,15,Fopposition to the plan.
OL,17,FBrabin has been answering questions as
OL,18,Fpart of Message the Mayor on BBC Radio
OL,19,FLeeds. She also talked about a proposed
OL,20,F"tourist tax", a trade trip to India
OL,21,Fand the latest efforts to tackle
OL,22,Fdomestic violence.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
